## Neighborhoods [/api/v2/customer/neighborhoods{?page,size,search,country_id,city_id}]  

<br/>List <a name="neighborhoods">Neighborhoods</a> for providing exacter location.

+ Parameters
    + page (number, optional) - The page number, by default it is set to 0
        + Default: 0
    + size (number, optional) - The size of the page, by default it is set to 20, max value 200
        + Default: 20
    + search (number, optional) - The Search Key filter
    + country_id (number, optional) - If you need specific country neighborhood, you should to provide country ID. See `Countries` API
    + city_id (number, optional) - If you need specific city neighborhood, you should to provide city ID. See `Cities` API


### List All Neighborhoods [GET]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

