## Service Types [/api/v1/service_types]  

<br/> <a name="service_type">Service types</a> are tariffs that determine the cost and delivery conditions.

### List All Service Types [GET]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
          
            {
                "data": {
                    "total": 11,
                    "list": [
                        {
                            "id": 494517375,
                            "code": "SUPER_EXPRESS",
                            "name": "Super Express Delivery",
