            }



## Package prices [/api/v2/customer/packages/prices/starting_from{?from_latitude,from_longitude,to_latitude,to_longitude,to_country_id,from_country_id,dimensions_length,dimensions_weight,dimensions_width,dimensions_unit,logistic_type,parent_customer_id,is_sub_customer,sender_address_type,recipient_address_type,price_calculation_type,from_city_name,to_city_name,page,size}]

<br/>

*Description*: List <a name="package_rules">Packages prices</a> to get estimate prices for delivery.

*Important*: If you do not have any result please recheck your package rules if 
they are active or contact with the provider administrator.

| Name | Required | Type | Description | Sample |
| ---- | -------- | ---- | ----------- | ------- |
| from_latitude | yes | Double | Latitude, where from parcel is going to be picked up | 25.137599 |
| from_longitude | yes | Double | Longitude, where from parcel is going to be picked up | 55.23740 |
| to_latitude | yes | Double | Latitude, where to parcel is going to be delivered | 25.076429 |
| to_longitude | yes | Double | Longitude, where to parcel is going to be delivered | 55.140504 |
| dimensions | yes | Object | Dimensions Data |  |
| to_country_id | yes | Integer | Country id retrieved from <a href="#countries">Countries Api</a> | 229 |
| from_country_id | yes | Integer | Country id retrieved from <a href="#countries">Countries Api</a> | 229 |
| from_city_name | no | String | City name | 229 |
| to_city_name | no | String | City name | 229 |
| price_calculation_type | no | Sring | One of <b>TOTAL_WEIGHT</b>, <b>BOX_WEIGHT</b>, <b>BOX_COUNT</b>, <b>TOTAL_VOLUME</b> | <b>TOTAL_WEIGHT</b> |
| parent_customer_id | no | Integer | Id of the parent customer| Default null|
| is_sub_customer | no | Boolean | If its sub customer | |
| sender_address_type | no | String optional | One of <b>ADDRESS</b>, <b>LOCKER</b>, <b>POST_OFFICE</b>, <b>TWAREHOUSE</b> | NULL |
| recipient_address_type | no | String optional | One of <b>ADDRESS</b>, <b>LOCKER</b>, <b>POST_OFFICE</b>, <b>WAREHOUSE</b> | NULL |
| logistic_type | no | String | One of <b>REGULAR</b>,<b>REVERSE</b>,<b>FOOD_DELIVERY</b> | <b>REGULAR</b> |
| size | no | Integer | Size of result | 20 |
| page | no | Integer | Page of result | 0 |

### Get Package Prices [GET]

+ Parameters
    + from_latitude (double, optional) - Latitude, where parcel is going to be picked up from
        + Default: 25.137599
    + from_longitude (double, optional) - Longitude, where parcel is going to be picked up from
        + Default: 55.23740
    + to_latitude (double, optional) - Latitude, where parcel is going to be delivered to
        + Default: 25.076429
    + to_longitude (double, optional) - Longitude, where parcel is going to be delivered to
        + Default: 55.140504
    + from_country_id (number, optional) - Country id where parcel is going to be delivered from
        + Default: 229
    + from_city_name (string, optional) - City name where parcel is going to be delivered from
        + Default: 229
    + to_country_id (number, optional) - Country id where parcel is going to be delivered to
        + Default: null
    + to_city_name (string, optional) - City name where parcel is going to be delivered to
        + Default: null
    + dimensions_length (number, optional) - Dimensions Data
        + Default: 2
    + dimensions_weight (number, optional) - Dimensions Data
        + Default: 2
    + dimensions_width (number, optional) - Dimensions Data
        + Default: 2
    + dimensions_unit (string, optional) - Dimensions Data
        + Default: METRIC
    + `price_calculation_type` (sring,optional) - One of <b>TOTAL_WEIGHT</b>, <b>BOX_WEIGHT</b>, <b>BOX_COUNT</b>, <b>TOTAL_VOLUME</b>
        + Default: TOTAL_WEIGHT
    + `parent_customer_id` (number, optional) - Parent Customer Id
        + Default: null
    + `is_sub_customer` (boolean, optional) - if its for sub customer
        + Default: false
    + `logistic_type` (string, optional) - One of <b>REGULAR</b>,<b>REVERSE</b>,<b>FOOD_DELIVERY</b>
        + Default: REGULAR
    + `sender_address_type` (string, optional) - One of <b>ADDRESS</b>, <b>LOCKER</b>, <b>POST_OFFICE</b>, <b>WAREHOUSE</b>
        + Default: null
    + `recipient_address_type` (string, optional) - One of <b>ADDRESS</b>, <b>LOCKER</b>, <b>POST_OFFICE</b>, <b>WAREHOUSE</b>
        + Default: null
    + page (number, optional) - The page number, by default it is set to 0
        + Default: 0
    + size (number, optional) - The size of the page, by default it is set to 20, max value 200
        + Default: 20
        


+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
    
