## Food Delivery [/api/v2/food/order] 
Before you start using food order endpoints make sure your company configured properly:
Couriers, Package Pricing Rules, Customers. 
When you create package rule for courier make sure that customer and courier are set 
and LogisticType must be FOOD_DELIVERY.

Note: In order to use these endpoints you must be signedin as Customer

### List Food Delivery Order [POST /api/v2/food/order/list]
    Retrieves list of food order

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
                Accept: application/json
                Authorization: Bearer id_token
                
    + Body
    
            {
                    "page": 0,
                    "size": 20,
                    "search": "search text",
                    "status": "comma delimited list of status values",
                    "paymentType":"cash"
            }
+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "data": {
                "total": 1,
                "list": [
                    {
                        "description": "string",
                        "driver_tip": 0,
                        "external_driver_fee": 0,
                        "meta_data": [
                            {
                                "key": "string",
                                "value": "string"
                            }
                        ],
                        "payment_total": 0,
                        "marketplace_id": 909678003,
                        "reference_id": "ON00000001",
                        "items_meta_data": [
                            {"name":"Hotdog", "price_per_unit": 10.00 , "quantity": 10.00, "instruction": "string" }
                        ],
                        "pickup_datetime": "2021-02-01T11:34:13.354Z",
                        "deliver_datetime": "2021-02-01T11:34:13.354Z",
                        "courier_id": 935436297,
                        "sender": {
                            "name": "string",
                            "email": "string",
                            "phone": "string",
                            "address": "string",
                            "lat": 41.261009216308594,
                            "lon": 69.27823638916016
                        },
                        "recipient": {
                            "name": "string",
                            "email": "string",
                            "phone": "string",
                            "address": "string",
                            "lat": 41.28117752075195,
                            "lon": 69.23995971679688
                        },
                        "payment_type": "cash",
                        "id": 935515950,
                        "status": "assigned_to_courier"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "status": "success"
        }
       

