###Get Driver location [GET /api/v1/public/order/{public_id}/driver/location]
    Retrieves driver's coordinates by order publicId. Only when driver assigned and on the way.
+ Parameters
    + public_id - Public ID of the food order
    
+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "data": {
                "id": "",
                "user_id": 495230072,
                "lat": number,
                "lon": number,
                "angle": number
            },
            "status": "success"
        }
        
## Order Tracking [/api/v1/customer/order/{order_number}/history_items]

<br/> <a name="order_tracking">Track order</a> to get the latest status updates.

### Track order [GET]

+ Parameters
    + order_number (string, required) - Order Number

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)
    
        {
          "data": {
            "total": 2,
            "list": [
              {
                "id": 17171717,
                "status": "assigned_to_courier",
                "status_desc": "Assigned to courier",
                "date": "2020-10-15T19:38:47.034Z",
                "created_by_user": {
                  "id": 3,
                  "name": "Test User",
                  "description": "shipox.test@gmail.com"
                },
                "supplier": {
                  "id": 17171717,
                  "name": "Test Express",
                  "phone": "+9713331717333"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1717171717,
                "status": "unassigned",
                "status_desc": "Order Received",
                "date": "2020-10-15T19:38:38.794Z",
                "created_by_user": {
                  "id": 3,
