## Canceling order [/api/v1/customer/order/{order_id}/status?status=cancelled]  

### Cancel order [PUT]

+ Parameters
    + order_id (number, required)


+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "status": "success"
            }
            
            
            
## AWBZ Label [/api/v1/customer/orders/airwaybill_mini{?ids,order_numbers}]  

<br/> Get the link to Order <a name="order_awb">AWBZ Label</a> in PDF format.

### AWBZ Label [GET]

+ Parameters
    + ids (enum[number], required) - List of Order ID’s:
        ids=123&ids=456&ids=789
    + order_numbers (enum[string], optional) - List of Order Number’s:
        order_numbers=a123&order_numbers=b456

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
          
            {
                "Data":{
                    "Value":"url to download awb from s3" 
                },
                "status": "success"
            }
            
            

## Customer Orders [/api/v1/customer/orders{?page,size}]  

| Name | Required | Type | Description |
| ---- | -------- | ---- | ----------- |
| from_date_time | No | String | Orders created from date |
| to_date_time | No | String | Orders created to date |
| status | No | Array[String] | The comma delimited list of status values |
| search | No | String | The Search Key filter |
| order_by | No | String |  Order by field |
| page | No | Number | The page number |
| size | No | Number | The size of the page |

### Get customer orders [GET]


+ Parameters
    + page (number, optional) - The page number, by default it is set to 0
        + Default: 0
    + size (number, optional) - The size of the page, by default it is set to 20, max value 200
        + Default: 20

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json
            Authorization: Bearer id_token
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
          
            {
              "data": {
                "total": 1,
                "list": [
                  {
                    "locations": [
                      {
                        "lat": 23.6234493,
                        "lon": 53.7325783,
