## Customer Sign Up [/api/v1/customer/register]  
Important: Before you send JSON request for adding new customer/user to your account you have to  provide "company_id", which can be received using the authentication api, using your admin or client credentials.

### Create customer [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Accept: application/json

    + Body
    
            {
              "company_id": 0,
              "username": "string",
              "password": "string",
              "phone": "string",
              "first_name": "string",
              "last_name": "string"
            }


