# Group Installing & Setup Shipox Wordpress/Woocommerce Plugin
#####A. Unzip and upload the plugin files to the website using dashboard/FTP
#####B. Select your instance:
1. Instance 1 for Shipox - Select instance 1 if you are a DMS user;
2. Instance 2 for Safe Arrival - Select instance 2 if you are a Safe Arrival merchant.
#####C. On the right menu, go to the Shipox Menu. There are 4 tabs with named as Service Configuration, Merchant Credentials, Merchant Address Details, and Order Settings. For Service Configuration:
1. Debug Mode – It is a TEST or LIVE version of the plugin, No: LIVE version, Yes: TEST version;
2. Auto Push – It can push the orders to the Shipox, after immediately received a new order.
#####D. The second tab is named as Merchant Credentials:
1. Enter your Shipox credentials and click Get Token. After that, you will be notified that you have successfully logged in;
2. Then, click the Save Changes Button.
#####E. Merchant Address Details Tab:
1. Fill all fields, all fields are required except postcode and details;
2. Latitude & Longitude Field is important so do not forget to fill it;
3. Click the Save Changes Button.
#####F. Order Settings Tab:
1. International Order Availability – If your store has international orders, please select Available;
2. Default Weight – is weight information of the order to push the Shipox. By default, it calculates the weight of each product of the order;
3. Default Courier Type – By default selected one or some needed courier types as default courier type. It will be used on AUTO PUSH;
4. Default Payment Option – It depends on Agreement with Shipox. According to DMS Company Agreement, you need to select Credit Balance or Cash;
5. Above settings will be considered based on the agreement with DMS Company.
#####G. If you want to disable packages from Shipox on your Checkout Page. Go to Woocommerce -> Settings -> Shipping -> Shipox. Enable/Disable to show the Checkout Page.
#####H. Orders Page:
1. To push the order to the Shipox (when AutoPush disabled or didn’t push the order automatically for some reasons) you can select Ship with Shipox Status and save the order;
2. After that, any response can be shown on the Order Notes Section as follows.